    content: {
      paragraphs: [
        'Consistency starts with the everyday. The Constant pairs a relaxed straight leg with a drawstring waist and clean, open hems. A simple foundation for early starts, quiet evenings and the work in between.',
        'The fleece is 85% cotton and 15% polyester, weighing 460 gsm (13.6 oz/yd²), with slight stretch. TapStitch lists WK1007 as a unisex, mid-rise style.',
        'Choose Black Beauty, Lucent White, Bone or Charcoal. The gallery starts with front and back mockups of every color, followed by supplier fit references and construction close-ups. Minor differences in shade between batches are normal.',
      ],
      specs: [
        ['Fabric', '85% cotton, 15% polyester fleece. 460 gsm (13.6 oz/yd²). Slight stretch.'],
        ['Fit', 'Relaxed unisex straight leg, mid-rise waist, full length. S–2XL.'],
        ['Details', 'Elasticated drawstring waist, side pockets and open hems.'],
        ['Colors', 'Black Beauty, Lucent White, Bone and Charcoal.'],
      ],
      care: ['Machine wash at 30°C on a gentle cycle.', 'Do not bleach.', 'Tumble dry low.', 'Iron at low temperature, avoiding any print.', 'Do not dry clean.'],
